ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330890/extras/b844f5157616f734cfb370a9630cc695.webm?t=1734395460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330890/extras/b844f5157616f734cfb370a9630cc695.mp4?t=1734395460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
